{
  "name": "history-three-entries",
  "description": "Three history entries: calendar years until 2021, a fifteen-month transition 2022-01-01 to 2023-03-31, 1 April years with quarters of 3 months from 2023, the same 1 April years with three quarters of 4 months from 2026-04-01 (an entry without a transition), a nine-month transition 2028-04-01 to 2028-12-31, then calendar years from 2029. Numbered by 'start', every number from 2020 to 2030 names one fiscal year. shift crosses all three changes, counting each year's own quarters. Illustrative.",
